            <profile name="Ancestral Bearing" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait" hidden="false" id="2604-a8d3-ea2e-4f54">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">Friendly Votann units within 12" of the Warlord use his Leadership. In addition, while the Warlord is on the battlefield, your army may make one additional reaction in your opponent's Assault phase, above its normal Reaction Allotment.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
