              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">The Warlord and any unit he joins treat every enemy unit as though it had one Judgement token, or one more than it has, to a maximum of two. In addition, while the Warlord is on the battlefield, your army may make one additional reaction in your opponent's Shooting phase, above its normal Reaction Allotment.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
