  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Eye of the Ancestors (Judgement)" id="9191-9822-8db6-275c" hidden="false" publicationId="e1a3-795b-be05-784b">
      <description>The Kin never forget a slight. After both armies have deployed, choose up to two enemy units; each gains one Judgement token. During the game, an enemy unit gains one Judgement token each time it destroys a Votann unit, to a maximum of two tokens. Units with this rule gain the following against enemy units with Judgement tokens: Tokens: Benefit. 1: Re-roll to-hit rolls of 1. 2: Re-roll to-hit rolls of 1 and to-wound rolls of 1.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Slow but Sure" id="fd19-24cc-00f6-3ef0" hidden="false" publicationId="e1a3-795b-be05-784b">
      <description>The Kin are short and heavily equipped. Votann Infantry have a Movement Characteristic of 5 unless their entry says otherwise, but may Advance and still shoot Rapid Fire weapons and declare charges in the same turn†.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Stealth" id="c4d7-f993-1a1d-9a93" hidden="false" publicationId="e1a3-795b-be05-784b">
      <description>If the model has not moved this turn, it cannot be targeted by ranged attacks from more than 12" away.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Stubborn Kin" id="b9c6-1e4f-c03f-56fb" hidden="false" publicationId="e1a3-795b-be05-784b">
      <description>Votann Infantry units may re-roll failed Morale checks while they have at least half their starting models.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Void Armour" id="aae4-08fe-8918-77c0" hidden="false" publicationId="e1a3-795b-be05-784b">
      <description>Votann void armour seals against hostile environments. Units with void armour (see Wargear) ignore the Pinning special rule from Blast and Template weapons†.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Ancestral Lore (X)" id="7bc4-43dd-5e6c-2ad5" hidden="false" publicationId="e1a3-795b-be05-784b">
      <description>A Grimnyr knows the Ancestral Wrath psychic weapon, plus X psychic powers from the table below, chosen when the army is built. Power: Kind, Phase, Effect. Ancestral Ward: Psychic power, Movement (start), The Grimnyr and any unit he has joined gain a 4+ Invulnerable Save against psychic weapons and a 5+ Invulnerable Save against everything else, until the start of your next turn.. Ancestral Wrath: Psychic weapon, Shooting, 18", S6, AP 3, Assault D6, Psychic. Fortify: Psychic power, Movement (start), One friendly Votann unit within 12" gains Feel No Pain (6+), or improves an existing Feel No Pain by 1, until the start of your next turn.. Null Vortex: Psychic power, Shooting, Enemy psykers within 18" subtract 2 from their Leadership for Psychic checks until the start of your next turn..</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="League (X)" id="8aaa-89ad-e8cb-8d09" hidden="false" publicationId="e1a3-795b-be05-784b">
      <description>When building an army, choose one League for each detachment. Every unit in that detachment gains League (X), where X is the chosen League. Unique characters may join any League.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Invulnerable Save (X)" id="a75a-fe58-e375-cdb8" hidden="false" publicationId="e1a3-795b-be05-784b">
      <description>The model has an Invulnerable Save of X, which may be taken against any Wound instead of its armour save.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
